  s0: No search yet
  s1: In queue
  s2: Processing, one run holds the claim
  s3: Completed, shortlist shown
  s4: Failed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start a search
  s1 --> s2: one of the two runs claims it, the other is refused
  s2 --> s3: the run delivers the shortlist
  s2 --> s4: the run reports a failure
